The '''Confederal Army''' ({{Langx|bl|Ejercito Confederales}}), is the army of [[Balisca]], responsible for ground-based warfare. It is the largest of the military branches of the [[Confederal Armed Forces]] with 265,000 members {{As of|2024|lc=y}}. It is separate from, but cooperates extensively with the [[Autonomous Militia]]s.

